<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I am the Lord’s! It is the glad confession</l><l>Wherewith the Bride recalls the happy day,</l><l>When love’s “I will” accepted Him forever,</l><l>“The Lord’s,” to love, to honor and obey.</l><l>“The Lord’s,” to love, to honor and obey.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I am the Lord’s! Yet teach me all it meaneth,</l><l>All it involves of love and loyalty,</l><l>Of holy service, absolute surrender,</l><l>And unreserved obedience unto Thee.</l><l>And unreserved obedience unto Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I am the Lord’s! Yes; body, soul, and spirit,</l><l>O seal them irrecoverably Thine;</l><l>As Thou, Beloved, in Thy grace and fullness</l><l>Forever and forevermore art mine.</l><l>Forever and forevermore art mine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
